  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPPORT TO TRAINING SCHOOL FOR DEAF &amp; BLIND YOUTH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Wisdom Vocational College is for Students with physical and mental disabilities. There are 70 boarders at any one time who live at the college 24/7. Students range from 12 years old up to 25 years. Once they are 25, they must leave the College. This project looks at supporting the college by improving the sanitation and classroom facilities. The project will also look at ways to improve how the young people are living at the college.</narrative>
  </description>
